   "id": 632847,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\">\n  <li>Which of the following represents a function that has experienced a horizontal compression?&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1225623,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x) = x^2\">f(x) = x^2</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225626,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x) = (\\frac 52x)^2\">f(x) = (\\frac 52x)^2</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225624,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x) = (\\frac 15x)^2\">f(x) = (\\frac 15x)^2</span>"
    },
    {
